WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,850 --> 00:00:02,130
Is it Liu Daxian?

2
00:00:02,130 --> 00:00:03,290
My daughter is dead

3
00:00:03,290 --> 00:00:04,930
The boss with his eyes open before death

4
00:00:04,930 --> 00:00:06,010
No matter what, I can't force it

5
00:00:06,010 --> 00:00:07,810
It's convenient for you to come and see uncle

6
00:00:07,810 --> 00:00:08,770
I'm not doing this job

7
00:00:08,770 --> 00:00:09,810
You've got the wrong person

8
00:00:09,810 --> 00:00:10,730
I'm a fairy

9
00:00:10,730 --> 00:00:13,130
If it’s not Mr. Yin Yang, why don’t you go?

10
00:00:13,130 --> 00:00:14,050
I feel wronged at first glance

11
00:00:14,050 --> 00:00:15,450
Just ask Lao Xian if he can

12
00:00:15,450 --> 00:00:17,730
I never live in vain, Oda, remember

13
00:00:17,730 --> 00:00:19,250
There must be three things I don’t watch in the future

14
00:00:19,250 --> 00:00:21,170
First, if you don’t look at lifespan, that’s a secret.

15
00:00:21,170 --> 00:00:22,410
Leaking the secret will make you lose weight

16
00:00:22,410 --> 00:00:23,650
Second, don’t watch Jiang die

17
00:00:23,650 --> 00:00:24,690
The king of hell asked him to die three times.

18
00:00:24,690 --> 00:00:25,770
Who dares to keep him in Hugeng?

19
00:00:25,770 --> 00:00:28,010
Thirdly, if you don’t believe in people, they will reject you.

20
00:00:28,010 --> 00:00:29,130
Even out of nothing

21
00:00:29,130 --> 00:00:30,210
These three

22
00:00:30,210 --> 00:00:31,930
I have to remember it forever

23
00:00:31,930 --> 00:00:41,700
No one in my family believes this

24
00:00:41,700 --> 00:00:43,320
Do you still want to deal with it?

25
00:00:43,320 --> 00:00:45,400
It's no problem, I'll take it

26
00:00:47,950 --> 00:00:49,750
Is it Master Liu?

27
00:00:49,750 --> 00:00:52,250
follow me

28
00:00:52,250 --> 00:00:53,250
old man

29
00:00:53,250 --> 00:00:54,330
Where is Tang Dan?

30
00:00:54,330 --> 00:00:56,650
There is an aura of the immortal family’s existence

31
00:00:56,650 --> 00:01:01,030
Now only old Liu, a lonely wild ghost, is left

32
00:01:01,030 --> 00:01:03,240
What did you see?

33
00:01:03,240 --> 00:01:04,800
We want to see the dead

34
00:01:04,800 --> 00:01:06,430
Is it convenient? OK

35
00:01:06,430 --> 00:01:07,590
come with me
